{"id":"durchaus","lemma":"durchaus","pos":"adv","rank":2510,"glosses":["absolutely, fully, entirely","absolutely, definitely, certainly, in any case"],"ipa":"/dʊrçˈaʊ̯s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/be/De-durchaus.ogg/De-durchaus.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Das ist durchaus möglich.","en":"It's quite possible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566711","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"possible"}]},{"text":"Er könnte durchaus recht haben.","en":"He may well be right.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"to be right"]]},{"text":"Dem stimme ich durchaus zu.","en":"I guess I agree with that.","words":[{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"voice"},{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to / too"}]},{"text":"Ich verstehe durchaus, worum es geht.","en":"I am not missing the point.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hear and interpret","l":"verstehen"},null,{"g":"about what"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"}]},{"text":"Durchaus ein paar Amerikaner mögen Sushi.","en":"Quite a few Americans like sushi.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"American )"},{"g":"to like"},{"g":"sushi"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"some"]]}]}